              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora MUKAMA ebi atarukwenda, yakwata engeso nk'eza Yerobbowamu, yakora n'ekibi eki yakoleze Abaisirairi.",
